title: "RUIN framework: Specification, analysis pipeline, and ROMJIST 2010–2025 dataset"
version: "1.2.1"
date-released: "2026-10-18"
message: "If you use this framework or dataset, please cite the accompanying paper and this repository."
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Bocan
    given-names: Valer
